@host = http://localhost:5277
@token = paste-token-from-login-here

### Log in as the seeded admin (Development only)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@library.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

### List books
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Books?page=1&pageSize=20

### Books from 1940 onwards with a copy on the shelf, newest publication first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Books?yearFrom=1940&available=true&sortBy=Year&sortDirection=Desc

### Authors with the most books first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Authors?sortBy=BookCount&sortDirection=Desc

### Search books
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Books/search?term=1984

### List genres
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Genres

### Create a genre (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Genres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Science Fiction", "description": "Speculative fiction" }

### Borrow the seeded book "1984" (any signed-in user)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Books/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/borrow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My loans
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Loans/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Return a loan (replace the id)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Loans/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue loans (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Loans/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a new access token (paste the refreshToken from login)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here" }

### Log out
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here" }

### List users (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Promote a user to Admin (replace the id)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/Users/user-id-here/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": ["User", "Admin"] }
